# 运行产物：每次采集/推演都会变，不进版本库
# 注意：run-pipeline.js 实际写 <repo>/reports/，不是 human-future/reports/。
# 旧版 gitignore 只忽略了后者，导致前者的 full-report-* 会漏进版本库（2026-10-08 补）。
human-future/data/collected-news.json
human-future/data/analysis-result.json
human-future/data/prediction-ledger.json
human-future/reports/full-report-*.json
human-future/reports/full-report-*.md
human-future/reports/report-*.md
human-future/reports/projection-*.md
human-future/reports/latest.json
human-future/reports/latest.md
reports/full-report-*.json
reports/full-report-*.md
reports/report-*.md
reports/projection-*.md
reports/latest.json
reports/latest.md

# 自我修正登记簿保留入库：它是跨会话累积的知识资产
!human-future/data/self-corrections.json

# 同步脚本临时文件
human-future/data/.commit-msg.tmp
